    "detailed_description": "<strong>NOTICE: This is the Chapter 1, The chapters will be released gradually. People who purchase the game will have access to all updates for free.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hello, this is Tsukasa speaking, and welcome to your new job. Here, we don't work from an office because your home is the office.</h2><br>In this adventure, you are Kuta, a boy who was fired and luckily helped by his childhood friend Kaori. We are normal people, but when it comes to our performance bonuses, we fight using a very ancient method... The... Umm... Pong?...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The protagonists:</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978070/extras/81de28cd3028ef19cb36b10ba7190770.avif?t=1751159962\" width=621 height=441 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978070/extras/d1832a83d2750610a8e0716ace027f90.avif?t=1751159962\" width=621 height=441 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978070/extras/440ba0775bd37cd901d9b122116e6a57.avif?t=1751159962\" width=621 height=441 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978070/extras/0599c6d7badbd97440393781bbc46363.avif?t=1751159962\" width=621 height=441 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978070/extras/2135b2a9df2b7a5049234b46ce4ea859.avif?t=1751159962\" width=621 height=441 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>In-Game Calendar:</strong> Time progresses according to an in-game calendar.<br></li><li><strong>Random Mood System:</strong> Characters can have different moods that affect interactions.<br></li><li><strong>Total of 25 Events:</strong> There are 5 events available for each of the 5 protagonists, offering a variety of situations and moments.<br></li><li><strong>Special Calendar Events:</strong> Includes celebrations like Valentine's Day and White Day.<br></li><li><strong>Pong Minigame:</strong> Here is where women become women, or rather, this place has become a gambling den thanks to Pong.<br></li><li><strong>Affinity System:</strong> Helps unlock specific events by developing closer relationships with the characters.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The chapters will be released gradually. People who purchase the game will have access to all updates for free.</strong></h2>",
